  - elementId: slide-35-node-818-Text-8
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 50.4
      - 147.6
      - 410.4
      - 345.6
    content:
      fontFamily: Calibri
      fontSize: 12
      color: '#7C3AED'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: '<p><span style="color:#7C3AED;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">位置</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    主解码器 4 个 level 各一份: sa1 (H/16)、sa2 (H/8)、sa3 (H/4)、sa4 (H/2)。</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#7C3AED;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">输入</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    features (当前级解码特征) + original_input (原图)。</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#7C3AED;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">计算流程</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    1. 将原图插值到当前特征分辨率</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    2. 计算局部均值与局部对比度 (sliding pool)</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Consolas">    3. spec_prior = clamp(0.75·input + 0.25·local_contrast, 0, 1)</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    4. 用多个阈值生成多级软 mask (高光→中亮→暗部)</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    5. cat(features, masks) → Conv → attention map</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Consolas">    6. output = features · (1 + scale · attention)</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#7C3AED;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">作用</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    使主解码器在每一级都能参考原图亮度与局部对比度, 显式知道“当前像素是否处于潜在高光区域”。</span></p>'
    sourceLayout: 4450735fabc995c85834634db6d8395551c3cc55989e638a50a996e7a46ad496
